  "worked_solution": "- Statement I is true since $PQ=QR=20$ units.\n\n- Statement II is false since $PR=40$ units, while $QS=50$ units. So, $\\overset{―}{PR}≇\\overset{―}{QS}.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Indeed, we have that $PR=40$ units, while $RS=30$ units. So, $PR\\ne RS.$\n\nTherefore, only statement I is true.",
